Refactor the existing backend system to remove all embedding-related logic and shift the architecture to a format-agnostic knowledge extraction pipeline.

1. Remove Embedding Logic
- Remove or disable _encode_batch_async and all embedding/vector API calls.
- Remove dependency on embedding endpoints and related retry logic.
- Ensure existing ingestion and search flows continue to work without embeddings.

2. Multi-Format Ingestion Layer
- Extend ingestion to support multiple input formats:
  - Excel (.xlsx, .xls)
  - PDF (.pdf)
  - Word (.docx)
  - CSV (.csv)
  - Plain text / logs
- Implement format-specific parsers:
  - Excel: structured sheet parsing
  - PDF/Word: text extraction with section awareness
  - CSV: row/column mapping
- Normalize all extracted data into a common intermediate structure.

3. Unified Knowledge Model
- Convert parsed content into a structured JSON model capturing:
  - entities (fields/attributes)
  - rules (validations, conditions)
  - transformations (imputations, derivations)
  - decisions (strategy/eligibility logic)
  - outputs
  - relationships between all components
- Ensure model is format-independent.

4. Traceability Engine
- Build mappings:
  - input/source → rules → transformations → decisions → outputs
- Support reverse trace:
  - output → contributing inputs and rules
- Store traceability in structured format for API consumption.

5. Refactor Existing APIs (do not redesign from scratch)
- Update ingestion endpoint to:
  - accept multiple file formats
  - trigger parsing + model building
- Update retrieval endpoints to return:
  - structured knowledge model
  - traceability mappings
- Keep existing working endpoints intact.

6. Artifact Generation
- Generate artifacts from the unified model:
  - BRD (structured requirement document)
  - Decision/Rule workbook
  - Traceability Matrix
- Ensure artifacts are derived from model, not raw files.

7. Maintain Stability
- Do NOT break existing:
  - file upload flow
  - ingestion pipeline (where working)
  - search functionality
- Only remove embedding-related parts and refactor processing.

8. Modular Structure
- parsers/ → format-specific extractors
- normalizer/ → converts raw data to common structure
- model_builder/ → builds unified knowledge model
- traceability/ → mapping engine
- artifacts/ → document generation
- api/ → FastAPI endpoints (refactored)

Goal:
Transform the system into a format-agnostic knowledge extraction and traceability engine that works across Excel, PDF, Word, CSV, and text inputs without relying on embeddings.
